;;;;;; Martini lipid topology for di-C22:6 LS (DDLS), generated using:
; The Martini lipid itp generator version M3.l01  Args are: -alname DDLS -alhead 'S P' -allink 'G L' -altail 'DFFDD DFFDD'
; WARNING: Autogenerated and not all lipid headgroup and tail combinations have been tested;
;          used with care and see K.B. Pedersen et al. 2024 for guidance.
;
; Description:
;   A general model plasmalogen phosphatidylserine (LS) lipid corresponding to atomistic C22:6(4c;7c;10c;13c;16c;19c) di-docosahexaenoic acid tails.
; Parameterization:
;   This topology follows the standard Martini 3.0 lipid definitions and building block rules. 
;   Bonded parameters and mapping have been optimized as described in K.B. Pedersen et al. 2024.
; Reference(s): 
; K.B. Pedersen et al., The Martini 3 Lipidome: Expanded and Refined Parameters Improve Lipid Phase Behavior*, 
; ACS Central Science, 2025. doi: 10.1021/acscentsci.5c00755
; P.C.T. Souza et al., Martini 3: A General Purpose Force Field for Coarse-Grained Molecular Dynamics*, 
; Nature Methods, 2021. doi: 10.1038/s41592-021-01098-3
; Created: 2024.07.12
;
; Molecular topology and mapping of indices:
; CNO-PO4-GL1-D1A-D2A-D3A-D4A-D5A
;          |
;         PL2-D1B-D2B-D3B-D4B-D5B
;
;  1 - 2 - 3 - 5 - 6 - 7 - 8 - 9 
;          |
;          4 - 10- 11- 12- 13- 14
;
;@INSANE alhead=S P, allink=G L, altail=DDDDD DDDDD, alname=DDLS, charge=-1.0
;@RESNTEST DDL==DDLS if: atoms[0]==CNO
;@BEADS CNO PO4 GL1 PL2 D1A D2A D3A D4A D5A D1B D2B D3B D4B D5B 
;@BONDS CNO-PO4 PO4-GL1 PO4-PL2 GL1-PL2 GL1-D1A D1A-D2A D2A-D3A D3A-D4A D4A-D5A PL2-D1B D1B-D2B D2B-D3B D3B-D4B D4B-D5B 
;

